<% content_for :head do %>
  <% set_meta_tags(
    title: "About Us",
    description: "Wyoming USA LLC with engineering in Lahore, led by Ahmad Kamran. Software for legal, healthcare, construction and logistics in the US, UK, Canada and Australia.",
    keywords: "A'sTechware, about A'sTechware, software development company, automation engineering, Ahmad Kamran, legal tech software, healthcare software, construction software, logistics automation"
  ) %>
  <% about_base = Rails.env.production? ? "https://astechware.com" : root_url.chomp("/") %>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  <%= raw({
    "@context" => "https://schema.org",
    "@type" => "Person",
    "name" => "Ahmad Kamran",
    "url" => "#{about_base}/about",
    "jobTitle" => "Founder & CEO",
    "worksFor" => { "@type" => "Organization", "name" => "A'sTechware", "url" => about_base },
    "knowsAbout" => ["AI Agent Development", "Platform Engineering", "Custom Software", "Production AI", "Python Development", "FastAPI", "Node.js Development", "React", "Next.js", "Legal Tech Engineering", "Healthcare AI", "Construction Software", "Logistics Automation", "Trucking Dispatch", "Workflow Automation"],
    "sameAs" => ["https://www.linkedin.com/in/engr-ahmad-kamran"]
  }.to_json) %>
  </script>
<% end %>

<!-- Hero Section -->
<div class="hero-section hero-about py-5">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row align-items-center min-vh-50">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-9 mx-auto text-center">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-4" data-page-h1>
          About A&apos;sTechware
        </h1>
        <p class="lead mb-0" style="max-width: 820px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto">
          We build day-to-day AI and platforms for businesses that need systems that actually work. Here&apos;s our story, our team, and what we stand for.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="inner-sections">

  <!-- 1. Company Story -->
  <div class="py-5 bg-white" id="company-story">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto">
          <h2 class="heading-border heading-center mb-4 pb-3 d-inline-block">Company story</h2>
          <p class="large-para mb-4">
            A&apos;sTechware was founded to fill a gap we kept seeing: businesses that needed ready to use software and AI systems were getting either fragile demos or overbuilt solutions that never shipped. We started with a simple belief, that great engineering should be accessible to teams that don&apos;t have a full in house bench, and we&apos;ve stayed focused on that ever since.
          </p>
          <p class="large-para mb-4">
            We chose to specialize in AI and platform engineering because that&apos;s where the biggest leverage is. When we get it right, our clients don&apos;t just get a project delivered; they get systems that scale, comply, and deliver measurable results. We&apos;re here to build those systems with discipline, transparency, and a commitment to outcomes you can actually see.
          </p>
          <p class="large-para mb-4">
            <%# [[AHMAD: exact registered name, e.g. "Astechware LLC"]] %>
            A&apos;sTechware (AsTechware LLC) is a Wyoming, USA company, founded in 2022. Our engineering team is based in Lahore, Pakistan, and works with clients in the US, UK, Canada and Australia. Most of our clients are founders and operators building software around an industry they know.
          </p>

          <div class="about-mission-box p-4 mb-4">
            <h3 class="h5 mb-2">Our mission</h3>
            <p class="mb-0 lead">
              We take the busywork off teams by building software around the tools they already use.
            </p>
          </div>

          <h3 class="h5 mb-3">How we work</h3>
          <div class="row g-3">
            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-3">
              <div class="about-value-card p-3 h-100">
                <div class="about-value-icon mb-2"><i class="fa fa-rocket" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                <strong class="d-block mb-1">Real work, not a demo</strong>
                <p class="mb-0 small">We build the systems your team uses every day: intake, scheduling, estimates, dispatch and billing, connected to the tools you already have.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-3">
              <div class="about-value-card p-3 h-100">
                <div class="about-value-icon mb-2"><i class="fa fa-eye" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                <strong class="d-block mb-1">Transparency</strong>
                <p class="mb-0 small">Weekly demos, clear milestones, and open communication. You see progress and decisions at every step.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-3">
              <div class="about-value-card p-3 h-100">
                <div class="about-value-icon mb-2"><i class="fa fa-line-chart" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                <strong class="d-block mb-1">Measurable outcomes</strong>
                <p class="mb-0 small">We track hours saved, revenue recovered, and capacity increased. Success is defined by your business results.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-3">
              <div class="about-value-card p-3 h-100">
                <div class="about-value-icon mb-2"><i class="fa fa-key" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                <strong class="d-block mb-1">Client ownership</strong>
                <p class="mb-0 small">You own all code, infrastructure, and documentation from day one. No lock in, no proprietary hold.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

